1
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:52,060
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,442
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:53,443 --> 00:00:55,900
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,900
=Episode 6=

5
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:18,960
What's he doing here?

6
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,020
Who's he?

7
00:01:20,670 --> 00:01:21,500
You're new.

8
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:22,000
You don't know him.

9
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,800
He crossed all three big bosses.

10
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,680
He turned Langia upside down.

11
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,330
Boss.

12
00:01:31,470 --> 00:01:32,540
Who's the bald guy?

13
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:34,670
Suowen's top hitman.

14
00:01:34,850 --> 00:01:35,560
Suka.

15
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:36,340
They say

16
00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:38,000
every life he takes

17
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,160
adds a bead to his amulet bracelet.

18
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,400
So we can wrap this up today, right?

19
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:43,960
He's a dead man now.

20
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,190
Hey.

21
00:01:49,730 --> 00:01:50,460
Hey.

22
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,200
I have a ritual when I kill someone.

23
00:01:53,510 --> 00:01:54,790
I allow them three final words.

24
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,030
Go ahead.

25
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,443
Now even nobodies

26
00:01:58,444 --> 00:01:59,320
dare mouth off.

27
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:00,600
Your second one.

28
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:02,200
It's only been three years,

29
00:02:02,860 --> 00:02:04,600
and you've forgotten Mian's name?

30
00:02:05,190 --> 00:02:05,800
Mian?

31
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:07,160
What's that supposed to mean?

32
00:02:07,750 --> 00:02:08,560
Last one.

33
00:02:09,670 --> 00:02:10,840
Save that for your own last words.

34
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,490
They're fighting!

35
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,210
This is intense!

36
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,190
He's got a scar on his chest.

37
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,450
My brother said

38
00:02:59,450 --> 00:03:00,530
Mian has a black dahlia scar

39
00:03:00,531 --> 00:03:02,150
on his chest.

40
00:03:02,650 --> 00:03:04,100
Could he really be Mian?

41
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:04,910
This is...

42
00:03:05,570 --> 00:03:06,850
I told you.

43
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,720
Everyone in Langia knows my name.

44
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,710
Take my advice.
Don't get yourself killed.

45
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,840
Who knows if you're the real deal?

46
00:03:13,070 --> 00:03:14,500
Done with your last words?

47
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,680
Tell Suowen,

48
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,730
I'm coming for him soon.

49
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,720
Who exactly are you?

50
00:03:55,550 --> 00:03:56,090
I...

51
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,360
am Mian.

52
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:06,840
You still want to fight?

53
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,360
Boss, are we doing this?

54
00:04:09,010 --> 00:04:09,400
He's...

55
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,330
He's from Huaguo.

56
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,370
Get him!

57
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,250
Boss.

58
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,620
Mian vanished three years ago.

59
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,560
What if he really is Mian?

60
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,280
(This isn't nearly enough.)

61
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:23,420
(I need everyone to believe)

62
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,030
(that I really am)

63
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,560
(the King of Langia.)

64
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,360
It's you?

65
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:43,760
You're here.

66
00:04:44,860 --> 00:04:46,135
I come here a lot

67
00:04:46,136 --> 00:04:47,410
to provide medical care for the inmates.

68
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:48,880
I heard you got in a fight today.

69
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:50,120
What happened?

70
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:51,600
Just...

71
00:04:52,170 --> 00:04:53,800
bonding with my new cellmate.

72
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,200
Let me check your wound.

73
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,960
Are you hurt anywhere else?

74
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:17,960
No need.

75
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:18,880
I'll do it myself.

76
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:21,700
Hey.

77
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:22,120
Oh.

78
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:23,160
One more thing.

79
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,200
How did Lin Sihan die?

80
00:05:26,660 --> 00:05:27,920
What did Natuo do to her?

81
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,560
Do you know one of Natuo's secrets?

82
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,960
He's trafficking drugs at Grand Royal.

83
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:39,520
Sihan was killed by him.

84
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,200
Sihan

85
00:05:45,530 --> 00:05:46,040
killed herself to save me.

86
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,200
Don't worry.

87
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:53,040
I heard the police reopened your case.

88
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:56,040
I already know how to get out.

89
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:57,360
How?

90
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,040
Tell Ma Ding

91
00:06:01,690 --> 00:06:02,560
to teach a prisoner a lesson.

92
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,280
His name's Suka. He got hurt here today

93
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:05,360
and was sent to the hospital.

94
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,120
Make sure it hits the news.

95
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,360
Suka?

96
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,080
What are you planning?

97
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:12,680
Just do what I said.

98
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:15,160
Fine.

99
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:16,386
Let's see what else

100
00:06:16,387 --> 00:06:17,640
you're capable of.

101
00:06:30,380 --> 00:06:31,040
Look.

102
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,200
That guy has a dahlia on his chest.

103
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:33,310
Looks like he's new.

104
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,240
That's Mian.

105
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:37,280
He put Suka in the hospital
a few days ago.

106
00:06:43,570 --> 00:06:44,600
He's only in his twenties.

107
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,540
What are you doing?

108
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:49,160
Get down.

109
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,960
Watch where you're going!

110
00:06:52,130 --> 00:06:53,080
Get on your knees.

111
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,630
Lick my shoes clean.

112
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:57,950
Get up.

113
00:07:03,130 --> 00:07:04,040
What do you think you're doing?

114
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:09,600
You're an inmate.

115
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,760
Trying to play hero?

116
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,480
So inmates aren't people?

117
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,340
Why should they get bullied

118
00:07:14,341 --> 00:07:15,180
just for trying to eat?

119
00:07:18,110 --> 00:07:18,650
Get up.

120
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,140
No one's pushing you around today.

121
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,000
You're asking for it.

122
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:29,450
Fine.

123
00:07:30,330 --> 00:07:31,320
You dare break the rules?

124
00:07:31,530 --> 00:07:32,940
Not even Buddha can save you now.

125
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,500
You dare touch Mian?

126
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:36,560
Mian?

127
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,840
You're just a punk from Huaguo.

128
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,680
How could you be Mian?

129
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,260
Look!

130
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,800
That's Suka!

131
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,960
(At 2 p.m. today,)

132
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:45,960
(a man)

133
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,273
(was badly injured in a crash)

134
00:07:47,274 --> 00:07:47,880
(and died on the way to the hospital.)

135
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:51,160
(Police are searching
for the vehicle involved.)

136
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:54,220
(Anyone with information
is urged to come forward.)

137
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,750
He really is Mian!

138
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:57,695
Suka crossed him,

139
00:07:57,696 --> 00:07:58,880
then died the moment he left the prison.

140
00:07:58,880 --> 00:07:59,700
How'd he die just like that?

141
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:06,440
You...

142
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:07,790
You really are Mian?

143
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:17,470
Stop there.

144
00:08:20,370 --> 00:08:21,260
Did I allow you to leave?

145
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,120
Listen to me.

146
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,680
Don't do anything crazy.

147
00:08:27,210 --> 00:08:28,170
How many times did he hit you?

148
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,280
Hit him back.

149
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:33,130
You have to fight for your own dignity.

150
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:34,840
Get up.

151
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,030
Be brave.

152
00:08:44,160 --> 00:08:44,750
You dare...

153
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,860
Hit me and see what happens.

154
00:08:48,410 --> 00:08:51,840
Mian!

155
00:08:51,841 --> 00:08:55,270
Mian!

156
00:08:55,271 --> 00:08:58,700
Mian!

157
00:08:58,701 --> 00:09:02,130
Mian!

158
00:09:02,131 --> 00:09:05,560
Mian!

159
00:09:06,450 --> 00:09:07,830
No way!

160
00:09:08,690 --> 00:09:10,540
He's just a piggy

161
00:09:10,540 --> 00:09:11,520
who escaped from Dashan.

162
00:09:11,770 --> 00:09:13,010
Piggy!

163
00:09:14,270 --> 00:09:15,440
But...

164
00:09:15,550 --> 00:09:16,530
just like

165
00:09:16,690 --> 00:09:17,580
the rumors say,

166
00:09:18,470 --> 00:09:19,520
he really does have

167
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,770
a black dahlia scar on his chest.

168
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:26,600
Look! I've got a dahlia on my back too.

169
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,840
Guess I'm Mian!

170
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:30,320
Mian!

171
00:09:32,230 --> 00:09:33,160
Suka

172
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:33,880
had just been beaten badly

173
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,270
and sent to the hospital.

174
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:37,880
Then right after that,

175
00:09:38,370 --> 00:09:39,360
he died in a crash.

176
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:42,360
Someone obviously silenced him.

177
00:09:43,530 --> 00:09:44,660
He was under my nose

178
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,440
the whole time.

179
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,150
How did word get out?

180
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,020
If he is Mian,

181
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,610
he has people outside.

182
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,960
If he isn't Mian,
someone powerful is backing him.

183
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,530
Either way, he's no ordinary guy.

184
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,880
Who knew one little rat

185
00:10:05,270 --> 00:10:07,240
would be this hard to get rid of?

186
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:08,730
Warden.

187
00:10:09,540 --> 00:10:10,720
He's getting pretty bold

188
00:10:10,980 --> 00:10:12,040
on your turf.

189
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:16,790
Exactly.

190
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:20,540
Today he hits a guard.

191
00:10:20,890 --> 00:10:23,560
By tomorrow,
he'll be walking all over you.

192
00:10:27,050 --> 00:10:27,800
Don't worry.

193
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,600
On my turf,

194
00:10:30,330 --> 00:10:32,270
I won't tolerate even one rat

195
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,280
running wild.

196
00:10:34,110 --> 00:10:34,720
Then thank you,

197
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,560
Warden.

198
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,300
About his heart,

199
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:43,500
I want it while it's still beating.

200
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:47,810
Zhou Yan.

201
00:10:48,130 --> 00:10:49,240
The warden wants to see you.

202
00:10:58,050 --> 00:10:59,000
Put the word out.

203
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:01,280
The warden's going after Mian.

204
00:11:02,020 --> 00:11:03,320
Do it, or you're dead.

205
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:12,968
The warden's going after Mian.

206
00:11:12,969 --> 00:11:18,100
The warden's going after Mian.

207
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,440
I'm asking you one more time.

208
00:11:43,610 --> 00:11:44,750
Who exactly are you?

209
00:11:47,770 --> 00:11:49,010
Then I'm telling you again.

210
00:11:50,810 --> 00:11:51,400
I...

211
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,760
am Mian.

212
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,130
Young man.

213
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,300
You really went too hard on yourself.

214
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:05,660
Too bad the scar's still fresh.

215
00:12:07,130 --> 00:12:09,080
Mian got his scar ten years ago.

216
00:12:10,630 --> 00:12:11,710
Back then,

217
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,940
you were still in diapers.

218
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:18,520
Fine.

219
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,840
I don't care who you claim to be.

220
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:25,360
But let me tell you,

221
00:12:26,170 --> 00:12:27,350
in here,

222
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:30,240
I'm Mian, the one in charge.

223
00:12:43,430 --> 00:12:44,500
Warden, a call for you.

224
00:12:44,930 --> 00:12:46,100
Ready to talk?

225
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:56,880
Honey!

226
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:57,860
Help me!

227
00:12:58,270 --> 00:13:00,140
Hurry and beg Mr. Mian

228
00:13:00,140 --> 00:13:02,110
to let our family go!

229
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,720
(Dad, help me!)

230
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:04,290
(Dad...)

231
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:06,560
Let him go.

232
00:13:10,770 --> 00:13:11,260
Get out!

233
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:17,700
Mr. Mian.

234
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:19,920
I got a little carried away earlier.

235
00:13:20,850 --> 00:13:22,000
As long as you leave my family alone,

236
00:13:23,250 --> 00:13:24,610
name your terms.

237
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:25,670
I'll give you whatever you want.

238
00:13:29,010 --> 00:13:29,560
I want

239
00:13:31,420 --> 00:13:33,000
to be acquitted and released.

240
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,110
(Upon retrial, the court finds)

241
00:13:36,260 --> 00:13:37,780
(the evidence insufficient.)

242
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:39,340
(The original conviction is vacated.)

243
00:13:39,450 --> 00:13:42,810
(The defendant, Zhou Yan,
is hereby acquitted and released.)

244
00:13:42,810 --> 00:13:44,430
♪Dust rises along the border♪

245
00:13:44,430 --> 00:13:45,720
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

246
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,970
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

247
00:13:46,970 --> 00:13:48,410
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

248
00:13:48,410 --> 00:13:49,730
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

249
00:13:49,730 --> 00:13:51,170
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

250
00:13:51,170 --> 00:13:52,350
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

251
00:13:52,350 --> 00:13:54,030
♪My life is mine to bear♪

252
00:13:54,370 --> 00:13:56,390
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

253
00:13:56,730 --> 00:13:59,410
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

254
00:13:59,410 --> 00:14:01,760
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

255
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:04,040
♪My fate is mine to command♪

256
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:04,800
(Honey!)

257
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,520
(Help me!)

258
00:14:06,350 --> 00:14:07,400
(Hurry and beg Mr. Mian...)

259
00:14:08,820 --> 00:14:10,104
(I didn't kidnap)

260
00:14:10,105 --> 00:14:10,960
(the warden's family.)

261
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,640
(Someone powerful)

262
00:14:12,641 --> 00:14:13,620
(must be helping me from the shadows.)

263
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:17,160
Zhou Yan.

264
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,090
Someone wants to see you.

265
00:14:20,300 --> 00:14:24,840
Mian! Mian!

266
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:52,360
♪Dust rises along the border♪

267
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,870
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

268
00:14:53,870 --> 00:14:55,230
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

269
00:14:55,230 --> 00:14:56,550
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

270
00:14:56,550 --> 00:14:57,800
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

271
00:14:57,800 --> 00:14:59,140
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

272
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:00,500
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

273
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:01,780
♪My life is mine to bear♪

274
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:04,790
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

275
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:07,230
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

276
00:15:07,230 --> 00:15:09,900
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

277
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:11,180
♪My fate is mine to command♪

278
00:15:11,180 --> 00:15:12,360
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

279
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,850
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

280
00:15:13,850 --> 00:15:15,230
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

281
00:15:15,230 --> 00:15:16,540
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

282
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,890
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

283
00:15:17,890 --> 00:15:19,200
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

284
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,400
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

285
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,840
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

286
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,170
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

287
00:15:23,170 --> 00:15:24,490
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

288
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:25,850
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

289
00:15:25,850 --> 00:15:27,200
